{"applicability_conditions":"用于 XRD（Rigaku D/Max-2550，Co 辐射源，40 KV，150 mA，2°–110°，2°/min）数据的 Williamson-Hall 分析；假设碳化物对衍射的贡献可忽略（negligible diffraction contributions from carbides）。","identity":{"block_id":"b0029","equation_id":"equation_002","equation_number":"2","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\frac {\\Delta 2 \\theta \\mathrm{cos} \\theta}{\\lambda} = \\frac {0 . 9}{D} + \\frac {2 \\varepsilon \\mathrm{sin} \\theta}{\\lambda}\\tag{2}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.matchar.2025.115480"},"latex":"\\frac{\\Delta 2\\theta \\cos\\theta}{\\lambda} = \\frac{0.9}{D} + \\frac{2\\varepsilon \\sin\\theta}{\\lambda}","purpose":"Williamson-Hall 方程，用于将 XRD 衍射峰宽化分离为晶粒尺寸（晶块尺寸）效应与晶格应变效应两部分，进而估算位错密度 ρ。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"衍射峰的宽化量（峰宽，与衍射角相关）","symbol":"\\Delta 2\\theta","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"衍射角（Bragg 角）","symbol":"\\theta","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"X 射线波长（X-ray wavelength）","symbol":"\\lambda","unit":"nm","value":"0.154"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"表观晶粒（晶块）尺寸（apparent crystallite size）","symbol":"D","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"晶格应变（lattice strain）","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Scherrer 常数（形状因子）","symbol":"0.9","unit":null,"value":"0.9"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"应变项的系数","symbol":"2","unit":null,"value":"2"}],"unmapped":["位错密度由 ρ = 2√3 ε /(D b) 计算 [21]，其中 b 表示 Burgers 矢量模（magnitude of the Burgers vector）。"]}